# usr/bin/cuems-stop RETIRED in 1.3.0-16: hardcoded to a long-gone venue's power
# relay (192.168.3.20) and SSH targets (stagelab@192.168.2.20x), and its only
# caller was the equally dead /etc/acpi/ handler chain. The `cuems-stop` shell
# ALIAS in etc/profile.d/cuems.sh (stop the systemd targets) stays, and with the
# binary gone it is no longer ambiguous.

